1
00:00:00,050 --> 00:00:08,085
The fuel burns as it is sprayed in, while the piston is already moving out, so heat is added at roughly constant pressure.

2
00:00:08,085 --> 00:00:10,416
A flat line from two to three.

3
00:00:10,416 --> 00:00:13,880
Then the power stroke, and the exhaust at constant volume.

